 printed orphan-path warnings.\"},' '{\"id\":\"assess-design\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"structure:design-8c635a2acc70b570\",\"rationale\":\"Observed, no deltas.\"},' '{\"id\":\"assess-discover\",\"component\":\"pose-mcp\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"command:pose assess discover --no-persist --component pose-mcp\"},' '{\"id\":\"assess-integrate\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/engine-reads-raw-history-integration\",\"rationale\":\"Ran with --no-persist.\"},' '{\"id\":\"assess-tech-debt\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"command:pose assess tech-debt --no-persist\",\"rationale\":\"The scan reports itself incomplete: two spec sources could not be read.\"},' '{\"id\":\"closeout-check\",\"disposition\":\"deferred\",\"evidence\":\"command:pose closeout-check spec:pose-validate-index-reads-residuals\",\"rationale\":\"Ran; it cannot pass before the review is recorded and the spec is done.\"},' '{\"id\":\"review-check\",\"disposition\":\"deferred\",\"evidence\":\"command:pose review-check spec:pose-validate-index-reads-residuals\",\"rationale\":\"Ran; no review record exists yet.\"},' '{\"id\":\"suggest-review\",\"component\":\"pose-mcp\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"command:pose suggest review --path pose-mcp\"},' '{\"id\":\"surface-check\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"integration:pose-mcp/go/delivery-integration\",\"rationale\":\"Ran with --strict: zero findings.\"},' '{\"id\":\"validate\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Rests on the sealed result. The sandbox rerun FAILED: 236 steps, 224 pass, 11 fail, 1 timeout. Seen causes include HTTP 403 and ownership refusals of /var/tmp and /home; runtime-host, delegate-refused, file-mode and timeout failures were not root-caused, and none of the failing test names is one this change adds or edits.\"},' '{\"id\":\"validate\",\"component\":\"pose-mcp\",\"disposition\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"unit:pose-mcp/go/test\",\"rationale\":\"Rests on the sealed result. The sandbox rerun FAILED: 233 steps, 221 pass, 11 fail, 1 error, with network access denied; the eight focused tests of this change passed separately.\"}' ']}' '```' > \"$TMPDIR/draft.md\" && cat \"$TMPDIR/draft.md\" | \"$POSE_REVIEW_CLI\" review draft-check --draft - 2>&1 | tail -n 30","timeout":300000}}}
